ICOSale.setReferralTypeBps
├── when called by the owner with _refType = Influencer and _refPercentage ≤ BASIS_FEE_DIVISOR
│   └── it sets referralBonusBpsByType[Influencer] and emits ReferralTypePercentageUpdated with correct parameters
├── when called by the owner with _refType = Media and _refPercentage ≤ BASIS_FEE_DIVISOR
│   └── it sets referralBonusBpsByType[Media] and emits ReferralTypePercentageUpdated with correct parameters
├── when overwriting an existing percentage
│   └── it updates the stored value and emits the event
├── when _refPercentage is 0
│   └── it succeeds and stores 0
├── when _refType is invalid
│   └── it reverts with InvalidReferralType and does not change state
├── when _refPercentage > BASIS_FEE_DIVISOR
│   └── it reverts with InvalidReferralPercentage and does not change state
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount and does not change state
